### Create a Template

Source: https://resend.com/docs/cli

Creates a new email template. Requires a name, subject, and the path to a React Email component.

```bash
resend templates create --name "Welcome" --subject "Welcome to Acme" --react-email ./emails/welcome.tsx
```

--------------------------------

### Update an Email Template using Resend CLI

Source: https://resend.com/docs/cli

Use this command to update an existing email template. You can modify its name, subject, or the associated React Email file.

```shellscript
resend templates update <id or alias> --name "Updated Welcome" --subject "Welcome to Acme Updated" --react-email ./emails/welcome.tsx
```

--------------------------------

